recommend check-in (Claude) -- the lane's charter item 1 is closed and its item 2 is the next agent-doable one: docs/STOA.md holds its last row at STOA333 while thirteen rungs live only in their witnesses, and the compressor stands at 180 lines against a declared 80, which declared_ceiling already reports as grade-only. Three seats still want a word and none is mine to take: %295's shape (host tier, per-star roster, or a platform gate in the witness), the card at 24,572 of 24,576 with its own Prior-laps rule unobeyable for a third lap, and the deep debride at gate %5.
